ta":0.235,"currentRatio":1.636,"revGrowth":0.394,"earnGrowth":0.099,"fwdEps":null,"peg":null,"grossMargins":0.23048,"summary":"Modi Naturals Limited, together with its subsidiary, Modi Biotech Private Limited, engages in the manufacture and marketing of oils and deoiled cakes in India. It operates through Branded Business and Bulk Business segments. The company provides healthy olive oil and rice bran oil blend under the Oleev Olive oil and Oleev Active oil brands; multisource oil under Oleev Health Oil and Oleev Smart Oil brand name; and other edible oils under the Rizolo Rice bran oil, Miller Canola Oil, and Olivana Wellness Oil brands. It also offers rice bran wax; ready-to-cook pasta, macaroni, spaghetti, olives and jalapenos, hing, soups, and peanut butter under the Oleev Kitchen brand. In addition, the company manufactures and sells organic, inorganic, and synthetic chemicals derived from fermented high starch juice and various types of ethanol and products, including gases, effluent gases, power, steam, and bio fertilizers; and produces biofuels, such as ethanol for petroleum marketing companies. The company was formerly known as Anil Modi Oil Industries Limited and changed its name to Modi Naturals Limited in October 2009. Modi Naturals Limited was incorporated in 1974 and is based in New Delhi, India.","employees":452,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":null,"asOf":1795529538},"analyst":null,"cap":"Other","caFix":null,"fetched":1795529538,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"Modi Naturals\" when:90d","items":[{"t":"Yashhtej Industries (India) Ltd Share Price","s":"Business Today","d":1795500786,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxORlJBTFFBLVJpMWx6NFp2aUs1dFEyd0N2RzVvUXl6SUpDb1lCR2tpbUk0SEFwdlljQU00TFBxX1E1QUhxZVRoX0dWcHl4Z295X2c5RTRtWDNldk9UMktidmFaTUlBdTRHcU1SbzFZaGZwa3doS21VZjk5MGJfSnltazFldlp0NDBOREJ3aA?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Modi Naturals Investor Analysis | StockIQ","s":"The Econo